      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 4800,
      "duration_ms": 4800,
      "text": "咱们今天聊的这只童子鸡，它是来自安徽皖南高山区域的纯种土黄鸡。",
      "topics": [
        "identity_source"
      ],
      "boundary_prediction_ms": 4800,
      "cut_after_ms": 4800,
      "cut_refined_by_waveform": false,
      "boundary_rms": 0,
      "local_median_rms": 1805.4,
      "safe_score": 96,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "same_tts_segment_boundary"
      ],
      "play_start_ms": 0,
      "play_end_ms": 4800
    },
    {
      "id": "S002",
      "char_start": 31,
      "char_end": 66,
      "start_ms": 4800,
      "end_ms": 10667,
      "duration_ms": 5867,
      "text": "大家拿到手的时候，可以先别急着下锅，把袋子拆开，仔细看看这个鸡的状态。",
      "topics": [
        "general"
      ],
      "boundary_prediction_ms": 10667,
      "cut_after_ms": 10667,
      "cut_refined_by_waveform": false,
      "boundary_rms": 0.1,
      "local_median_rms": 1690.7,
      "safe_score": 96,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "same_tts_segment_boundary"
      ],
      "play_start_ms": 4800,
      "play_end_ms": 10667
    },
    {
      "id": "S003",
      "char_start": 66,
      "char_end": 105,
      "start_ms": 10667,
      "end_ms": 17067,
      "duration_ms": 6400,
      "text": "你会发现它的皮是比较薄的，皮下基本以精瘦肉为主，肉质呈现出一种相对紧实的感觉。",
      "topics": [
        "appearance_meat"
      ],
      "boundary_prediction_ms": 17067,
      "cut_after_ms": 17067,
      "cut_refined_by_waveform": false,
      "boundary_rms": 0.2,
      "local_median_rms": 1972,
      "safe_score": 96,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "same_tts_segment_boundary"
      ],
      "play_start_ms": 10667,
      "play_end_ms": 17067
    },
    {
      "id": "S004",
      "char_start": 105,
      "char_end": 127,
      "start_ms": 17067,
      "end_ms": 20533,
      "duration_ms": 3466,
      "text": "这种状态其实跟它在山上的生长过程是分不开的。",
      "topics": [
        "general"
      ],
      "boundary_prediction_ms": 20533,
      "cut_after_ms": 20533,
      "cut_refined_by_waveform": false,
      "boundary_rms": 0.1,
      "local_median_rms": 1041,
      "safe_score": 96,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "same_tts_segment_boundary"
      ],
      "play_start_ms": 17067,
      "play_end_ms": 20533
    },
    {
      "id": "S005",
      "char_start": 127,
      "char_end": 181,
      "start_ms": 20533,
      "end_ms": 29422,
      "duration_ms": 8889,
      "text": "它不是那种关在笼子里的圈养模式，而是属于跑山鸡、溜达鸡，在漫山遍野的高山环境里活动，平时的运动量是比较大的。",
      "topics": [
        "raising_activity"
      ],
      "boundary_prediction_ms": 29422,
      "cut_after_ms": 29422,
      "cut_refined_by_waveform": false,
      "boundary_rms": 0,
      "local_median_rms": 2340.7,
      "safe_score": 96,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "same_tts_segment_boundary"
      ],
      "play_start_ms": 20533,
      "play_end_ms": 29422
    },
    {
      "id": "S006",
      "char_start": 181,
      "char_end": 241,
      "start_ms": 29422,
      "end_ms": 39556,
      "duration_ms": 10134,
      "text": "正因为有这种放养空间，鸡在活动过程中会自己捕食一些小虫、小竹笋这些天然的东西，同时我们也会配合喂人工科学配比的安全食材。",
      "topics": [
        "raising_activity",
        "feeding"
      ],
      "boundary_prediction_ms": 39556,
      "cut_after_ms": 39556,
      "cut_refined_by_waveform": false,
      "boundary_rms": 0,
      "local_median_rms": 1806.8,
      "safe_score": 96,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "same_tts_segment_boundary"
      ],
      "play_start_ms": 29422,
      "play_end_ms": 39556
    },
    {
      "id": "S007",
      "char_start": 241,
      "char_end": 270,
      "start_ms": 39556,
      "end_ms": 44444,
      "duration_ms": 4888,
      "text": "这样做的逻辑很简单，就是让鸡吃得干净，咱们人才能吃得放心。",
      "topics": [
        "feeding"
      ],
      "boundary_prediction_ms": 44444,
      "cut_after_ms": 44444,
      "cut_refined_by_waveform": false,
      "boundary_rms": 0,
      "local_median_rms": 1827.8,
      "safe_score": 96,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "same_tts_segment_boundary"
      ],
      "play_start_ms": 39556,
      "play_end_ms": 44444
    },
    {
      "id": "S008",
      "char_start": 270,
      "char_end": 341,
      "start_ms": 44444,
      "end_ms": 56622,
      "duration_ms": 12178,
      "text": "现在下单的都是活鸡新鲜宰杀，而且我知道很多朋友特别在意完整性，我们这边是保留鸡胗、鸡肝、鸡心的，整只去头、去鸡屁股后切块发货，也就是原切状态。",
      "topics": [
        "slaughter_offal",
        "original_cut"
      ],
      "boundary_prediction_ms": 56622,
      "cut_after_ms": 56622,
      "cut_refined_by_waveform": false,
      "boundary_rms": 0.4,
      "local_median_rms": 2858,
      "safe_score": 96,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "same_tts_segment_boundary"
      ],
      "play_start_ms": 44444,
      "play_end_ms": 56622
    },
    {
      "id": "S009",
      "char_start": 341,
      "char_end": 371,
      "start_ms": 56622,
      "end_ms": 61956,
      "duration_ms": 5334,
      "text": "虽然切了块，但品质和整只的一样，像清蒸这种做法也完全没问题。",
      "topics": [
        "original_cut",
        "cooking"
      ],
      "boundary_prediction_ms": 61956,
      "cut_after_ms": 61956,
      "cut_refined_by_waveform": false,
      "boundary_rms": 0,
      "local_median_rms": 2176.3,
      "safe_score": 96,
      "safe_grade": "A",
      "safe_reason": [
        "same_tts_segment_boundary"
      ],
      "play_start_ms": 56622,
      "play_end_ms": 61956
    },
    {
